// Reverse-indexed catalog: MessageIndex maps a runtime-produced English message back to
// its key here, so the English value below MUST byte-match what the app actually produces.
// Placeholders are named: {field} is replaced by the form label, the rest pass through.
// Two families live here: Validation_* messages produced by BCL attributes, and Error_*
// messages thrown by the server and shown in an error toast. Our own validation attributes
// report a Validation_* key directly instead, so they live in Strings.*.json.
// An Error_* value that no longer matches the code silently falls back to AI translation -
// ServerErrorLocalizationTest is what keeps the two in sync.
// TODO(FC): the Validation_* entries here are temporary - see MessageIndex. The .NET 11 pipeline
// resolves IStringLocalizerFactory per call as of preview.7, so once the SDK is bumped off
// preview.6 the BCL attributes localize forwards too and only Error_ strings remain here.
